{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27127","headline":"宿隐静寺上人 · 周贺","name":"宿隐静寺上人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一宿五峰杯度寺，虚廊中夜磬声分。\n疎林未落上方月，深涧忽生平地云。\n幽鸟背泉栖静境，远人当烛想遗文。\n暂来此地歇劳足，望断故山沧海濆。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"周贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27127.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27127","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}